  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 743 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D13"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows sodium chloride as To Be Discontinued, first posted on 2018-06-21.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) ended on 2016-06-08 and was classified OAI, 743 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D13", "E37"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) on 2017-02-14, 492 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D14", "E42"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another FDA inspection of Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) ended on 2018-08-15 and was classified OAI, 55 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D18", "E39"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) ended on 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, 442 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D20", "E49"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 117 units of sodium chloride 9 mg/mL, 50 mL with 16.7 days on hand, while Corvale East holds 349 units with 9.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 18 units of 9 mg/mL, 50 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 10 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D28"]
    }
  ]
}
